          <a href="#metodo" class="min-h-12 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#11130f] px-5 py-3 font-extrabold text-[#f6edd7] hover:bg-[#9e4a2f] transition whitespace-nowrap">Ver método</a>
